  // seat) | match (a daughter of a house out there). base: what it goes for at the asking price (land: the price;
  // lease: the entry gift; post / place / seat / match: the gift or premium). decider: the house whose head decides
  // ("lord": the village's lord). first: the year after the hand-over it first comes up; every: then every so many
  // years (0: once). month: the month the bidding opens (it closes two months later). tier: only houses already in
  // 地方 may bid. gate: winning it is one of the ways into 地方 (design/district.md 五).
